  "notice": "Historical forest soil measurements from September 2021. Fungal biomass/necromass are source-reported biomarker-based estimates, not DNA richness, organism counts or a microbiome diversity index. Treatments and soil layers are separate; values are not directly comparable to Swedish ASV/Shannon data. No link to Apetit farms. One study-level coordinate; individual plot positions and spatial uncertainty are not supplied.",
  "methods": "Organic and upper mineral soil (0–20 cm) sampled in September 2021. Dataset reports fungal biomass based on ergosterol and necromass markers based on glucosamine. Source file units are retained: mg/g dry weight. Enzyme activities retain nmol/h/g dry weight. Sampling depth is layer-dependent; no exact depth is invented for the organic layer."
